      <title>向量存储不是你的新数据库信仰</title>
      <link>https://index.zshipu.com/stock002/post/20260904/%E5%90%91%E9%87%8F%E5%AD%98%E5%82%A8%E4%B8%8D%E6%98%AF%E4%BD%A0%E7%9A%84%E6%96%B0%E6%95%B0%E6%8D%AE%E5%BA%93%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%B0/</link>
